@startuml CloudWarehouse_CICD_Pipeline
title CI/CD Pipeline — GitHub Actions

|#LightBlue|Developer|
start
:git push or open PR\nto main branch;

|#LightGreen|GitHub Actions\nubuntu-latest|
:Checkout repository;
:Setup .NET SDK 9.x;
:dotnet restore\nCloudWarehouse.sln;
:dotnet test (Release)\n+ Coverlet coverage;
:Install ReportGenerator;
:Generate HTML coverage report;
:Upload artifacts\n(coverage-report,\ncoverage-cobertura);

|#LightBlue|Developer|
:Review workflow run\n(green checkmark);
:Download coverage-report\nfor evidence;

stop

@enduml

' 1. Every push to main triggers automated restore, build, and test on GitHub Actions.
' 2. We collect code coverage and publish HTML artifacts for audit evidence.
' 3. This satisfies the course requirement for demonstrable CI/CD, recordable on video.
